inned byte array its address; anything else an address of its own, made once)"] [346 1 "// convRes is a C result in its representation."] [369 1 "// CaseE is a case: its scrutinee evaluated under a case frame, then an alternative chosen."] [377 2 "// the alternatives indexed (HE4d): byTag by a constructor's tag once their constructors are loaded, byInt"] [378 2 "// by an integer literal's value; made at the case's first use with enough alternatives"] [384 1 "// index makes the case's tables (a case of four alternatives or more)."] [391 22 "// a constructor not loaded yet: again at the next use"] [461 1 "// cont chooses the alternative for the value in the return registers. A case of an algebraic type with a"] [462 1 "// default alone may see a function: a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype)."] [491 4 "// a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype): a default only"] [547 1 "// LetE allocates closures and constructors."] [560 14 "// staticCon"] [563 1 "// allocClosure is a closure of l with n free variables to fill: a function or a thunk, and its free slice."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[48 24] [58 48] [70 26] [294 37] [302 27] [316 30] [414 21] [439 31] [448 25] [498 20] [499 23] [526 22]]} (go/file "nodes.go" :imports [


